Aim:To design a simple HTML webpage and apply CSS styling to the heading and paragraph elements.

Algorithm:Create an HTML file.
Add the required personal details using <h1> and <p> tags.
Create a CSS file.
Set the <h1> text color to dark blue.
Set the <p> text color to pink.
Set the paragraph background color to black.
Link the CSS file with the HTML file.
Open the HTML file in a web browser and view the output.

code:
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>DETAILS</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="basic.css">
</head>
<body>
    <h1>DETAILS OF ME</h1>
    <p>Name: THANMAI REDDY</p>
    <p>Reg no: 192425372</p>
    <p>Subject code: CSA4303</p>
    <p>SUBJECT: Internet Programming</p>
    <p>Department: AIML</p>
</body>
</html>

CSS:
h1
{
    color: DarkBlue;
}

p
{
    color: Pink;
    background-color: Black;
}

Result:The webpage was created successfully with the required CSS styling.
